 Building Wellspring for UWP
---------------------------
Wellspring uses Visual Studio 2022 to build for UWP (Xbox One / Windows 10).

Dependencies
------------
Before building, download SDL3's UWP source code:

https://github.com/FNA-NET/SDL3-uwp

The SDL3-uwp repository should be checked out as a sibling directory to Wellspring:

  SDL3-uwp/
  Wellspring/

Compiling
---------
1. Build SDL3-uwp/VisualC-WinRT/SDL-UWP.sln
2. Build Wellspring.sln
3. Grab Wellspring.dll and SDL3.dll, ship it!
